ion, or collapse—not necessarily truth. Central question: who bears costs, who decides, and who can redirect costs? Distinguish (1) incentive threshold for controllers to prefer change from (2) capacity threshold for supporters to sustain the arrangement. Personal shutdown/trauma application is distinct and does not establish clinical cause.

